{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Diagonal twist with rotated vacua: SoV bases (gl(3), L=1)\n\nSame single-site adjoint setup as `Companion-B-C-diagonalize.wb`, but with a diagonal twist $G=\\mathrm{diag}(z_1,z_2,z_3)$. The vacua are rotated by $\\exp(p\\,E)$ factors whose parameters (`rotparams`) are fixed in terms of $z_a$; the SoV bases are then built from the same fused transfer matrices and their overlap matrix is checked.\n\n*Converted from `diagonalise-B-C-diagonal.nb` (2026-09-25).*",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## gl(3) generators in the Gelfand–Tsetlin basis",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n  ps[rep] = \n   Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #] & /@ (Tuples[\n          Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, \n            Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]))}, \n    If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, \n     Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := \n  J0[k][pat] = \n   Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := \n  Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[\n     Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, \n         Range[k + 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n         Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n       ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := \n  Jm[k][pat] = \n   Sum[Product[\n       pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/\n      Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n        Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n      ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := \n  JJ[k, l, rep] = \n   Which[k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]], l == k + 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l == k - 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l > k + 1, \n    JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep], l < k - 1, \n    JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Representation, Lax matrix, diagonal twist",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\\[CapitalLambda], \\[Nu]];\n\\[CapitalLambda][1] = {2, 1, 0};\n\\[Nu][n_][u_] := \n  Product[(u - \\[Theta][l] - h \\[CapitalLambda][l][[n]]), {l, 1}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\\[ScriptCapitalL], T, TG, TGS, Ee, EE];\nEe[\\[Alpha]_][i_, j_] := \n  Ee[\\[Alpha]][i, j] = JJ[i, j, \\[CapitalLambda][\\[Alpha]]];\nEE[i_, j_] := Ee[1][i, j];\n\\[ScriptCapitalL][\\[Alpha]_][i_, j_][u_] := \\[ScriptCapitalL][\\[Alpha]][i, j][u] = \n  u IdentityMatrix[dim[\\[CapitalLambda][\\[Alpha]]]] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - h Ee[\\[Alpha]][j, i];\nG = DiagonalMatrix[{z[1], z[2], z[3]}];\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[{i, j}][u] = \\[ScriptCapitalL][1][i, j][u - \\[Theta][1]];\n(* un-normalised: the \\[Nu] factors go on the fused transfer matrices instead, so the y basis at \\[Theta]+2h avoids the \\[Nu][1] pole *)\nTG[{i_, j_}][u_] := \n  TG[{i, j}][u] = \n   Sum[\\[ScriptCapitalL][1][i, k][u - \\[Theta][1]] G[[k, j]], {k, 3}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Quantum minors and fused transfer matrices",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[QM, tG, QMG];\nQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := \n  QM[Ii, Jj][u] = \n   Sum[Signature[\n      Permutations[\n        Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (T[#][\n           u + h - h Position[\n                Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #] // \n             Flatten // Last] & /@ \n         Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], \n     1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\nQMG[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := \n  QMG[Ii, Jj][u] = \n   Sum[Signature[\n      Permutations[\n        Ii][[\\[Sigma]]]] (Dot @@ (TG[#][\n           u + h - h Position[\n                Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}], #] // \n             Flatten // Last] & /@ \n         Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[\\[Sigma]]], Jj}])), {\\[Sigma], \n     1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\ntG[a_][u_] := \n  tG[a][u] = Sum[QMG[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[tR, t, tS];\n(* un-normalised fused transfer matrices *)\ntR[{1, 0}][u_] := tR[{1, 0}][u] = tG[1][u] // Simplify;\ntR[{1, 1}][u_] := tR[{1, 1}][u] = tG[2][u] // Simplify;\ntR[{2, 0}][u_] := \n  tR[{2, 0}][u] = tG[1][u] . tG[1][u + h] - tG[2][u + h] // Simplify;\ntR[{2, 1}][u_] := \n  tR[{2, 1}][u] = tG[2][u] . tG[1][u + h] - tG[3][u + h] // Simplify;\ntR[{2, 2}][u_] := \n  tR[{2, 2}][u] = \n   tG[2][u] . tG[2][u + h] - tG[3][u + h] . tG[1][u] // Simplify;\n(* left basis: normalised by \\[Nu][1] *)\nt[{0, 0}][u_] := t[{0, 0}][u] = IdentityMatrix[8];\nt[{1, 0}][u_] := t[{1, 0}][u] = tR[{1, 0}][u]/\\[Nu][1][u];\nt[{1, 1}][u_] := t[{1, 1}][u] = tR[{1, 1}][u]/(\\[Nu][1][u] \\[Nu][1][u - h]);\nt[{2, 0}][u_] := t[{2, 0}][u] = tR[{2, 0}][u]/(\\[Nu][1][u] \\[Nu][1][u + h]);\nt[{2, 1}][u_] := t[{2, 1}][u] = tR[{2, 1}][u]/(\\[Nu][1][u] \\[Nu][1][u + h] \\[Nu][1][u - h]);\nt[{2, 2}][u_] := t[{2, 2}][u] = tR[{2, 2}][u];\n(* right basis: shifted, normalised by \\[Nu][3] with the opposite shifts *)\ntS[{1, 0}][u_] := tR[{1, 0}][u]/\\[Nu][3][u];\ntS[{1, 1}][u_] := tR[{1, 1}][u + h]/(\\[Nu][3][u] \\[Nu][3][u + h]);\ntS[{2, 0}][u_] := tR[{2, 0}][u - h]/(\\[Nu][3][u] \\[Nu][3][u - h]);\ntS[{2, 1}][u_] := (tG[2][u + h] . tG[1][u - h] - tG[3][u + h])/(\\[Nu][3][u] \\[Nu][3][u + h] \\[Nu][3][u - h]);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Rotated vacua",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* p3 and the right-vacuum angles r_i are fixed in terms of p1, p2 and the twist *)\nrotparams = {p3 -> (p2 (-z[1] + z[3]))/(p1 (z[2] - z[3])), \n   r1 -> (p1 (z[2] - z[3]))/(p2 (z[1] - z[2])), \n   r2 -> (z[2] - z[3])/(p2 z[1] - p2 z[2]), \n   r3 -> (z[1] - z[3])/(p1 (-z[2] + z[3]))};",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "vacL = {{1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}} . MatrixExp[p1 Ee[1][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[p2 Ee[1][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[p3 Ee[1][2, 3]] /. rotparams;\nvacR = MatrixExp[r1 Ee[1][3, 2]] . MatrixExp[r2 Ee[1][3, 1]] . MatrixExp[r3 Ee[1][2, 1]] . ({{1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}} // Transpose) /. rotparams;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## SoV bases $\\langle x_A|$ and $|y_B\\rangle$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "gtpats = {{{1}, {0, 0}}, {{1}, {1, 0}}, {{1}, {1, 1}}, {{2}, {0, 0}}, {{2}, {1, 0}}, {{2}, {1, 1}}, {{2}, {2, 0}}, {{2}, {2, 1}}};\ngtpairs = Flatten[Table[{A1, A2}, {A1, gtpats}, {A2, gtpats}], 1];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "y[{{2}, {2, 1}}] = vacR;\ny[{{2}, {2, 0}}] = tS[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . Inverse[tS[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h]] . vacR // Simplify;\ny[{{2}, {1, 1}}] = tS[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . vacR;\ny[{{2}, {1, 0}}] = tS[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . y[{{2}, {2, 0}}];\ny[{{2}, {0, 0}}] = tS[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . y[{{2}, {2, 0}}];\ny[{{1}, {1, 1}}] = tS[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . vacR;\ny[{{1}, {1, 0}}] = tS[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . y[{{2}, {2, 0}}];\ny[{{1}, {0, 0}}] = tS[{2, 1}][\\[Theta][1] + 2 h] . y[{{2}, {2, 0}}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "x[{{1}, {0, 0}}] = vacL;\nx[{{2}, {0, 0}}] = vacL . t[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1]] . Inverse[t[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1]]] // Simplify;\nx[{{1}, {1, 0}}] = vacL . t[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1]];\nx[{{1}, {1, 1}}] = vacL . t[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1]];\nx[{{2}, {1, 0}}] = x[{{2}, {0, 0}}] . t[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1]];\nx[{{2}, {1, 1}}] = x[{{2}, {0, 0}}] . t[{1, 1}][\\[Theta][1]];\nx[{{2}, {2, 0}}] = x[{{2}, {0, 0}}] . t[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1]];\nx[{{2}, {2, 1}}] = x[{{2}, {0, 0}}] . t[{2, 1}][\\[Theta][1]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Overlap matrix $\\langle x_A|y_B\\rangle$\n\nWith the $\\nu$ factors on the transfer matrices the overlaps are $h$-independent; normalised by the common twist factor $(z_1-z_2)(z_1-z_3)^2(z_2-z_3)$. Rows $A$, columns $B$ in `gtpats` order.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Table[(x[A] . y[B])/((z[1] - z[2]) (z[1] - z[3])^2 (z[2] - z[3])) // Flatten // Last, {A, gtpats}, {B, gtpats}] // Simplify // MatrixForm",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"677717\" data-output-id=\"20\" data-out-n=\"266\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"17\" data-sub-start=\"0\" data-sub-end=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[266]//MatrixForm=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.6358em;vertical-align:-4.5679em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.0499em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.0499em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:9.600em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"9.600em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 9600\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3,682,-458,1162c-21.3,163.3,-33.3,349,\n-36,557 l0,6084c0.2,6,0,26,0,60c2,159.3,10,310.7,24,454c53.3,528,210,\n949.7,470,1265c4.7,6,9.7,11.7,15,17c0.7,0.7,7,1,19,1c0,0,18,0,18,0c4,-4,6,-7,6,-9\nc0,-2.7,-3.3,-8.7,-10,-18c-135.3,-192.7,-235.5,-414.3,-300.5,-665c-65,-250.7,-102.5,\n-544.7,-112.5,-882c-2,-104,-3,-167,-3,-189\nl0,-6092c0,-162.7,5.7,-314,17,-454c20.7,-272,63.7,-513,129,-723c65.3,\n-210,155.3,-396.3,270,-559c6.7,-9.3,10,-15.3,10,-18z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.5501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.0679em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.2228em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.0177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.8126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.2023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.0028em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.2079em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.5679em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.0679em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.2228em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.0177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4