  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* is vacL (1 + r t20 t10^-1) again a rotated highest-weight covector? solve for the new angles s_i *)\nvacL . (IdentityMatrix[8] + r t[{2, 0}][\\[Theta][1]] . Inverse[t[{1, 0}][\\[Theta][1]]]) // Simplify;\n% - (1 + r z[1]) {{1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}} . MatrixExp[s1 Ee[1][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[s2 Ee[1][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[s3 Ee[1][2, 3]];\nSolve[% == 0, {s1, s2, s3}] // Simplify",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
