  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## The rotation conjugates the twist\n\n$\\langle \\mathrm{HWS}|\\, P\\,\\mathrm{tr}[gT]\\,P^{-1} = \\mathrm{tr}[g\\,P T P^{-1}] = \\mathrm{tr}[g\\,P_a^{-1} T P_a] = \\mathrm{tr}[P_a\\, g\\, P_a^{-1}\\, T]$\n\nso rotating the vacuum is equivalent to replacing $g \\to P_a g P_a^{-1}$ in auxiliary space:",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ee[i_, j_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, ii] KroneckerDelta[j, jj], {ii, 3}, {jj, 3}];\nrotaux = MatrixExp[p1 ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[p2 ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[p3 ee[2, 3]] //. rotparams;\nrotaux . DiagonalMatrix[{z[1], z[2], z[3]}] . Inverse[rotaux] // Simplify // MatrixForm",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
